                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The United Nations Security Council met from 3 to 6:30 p. m. on November 16 with
                    debate continuing on the draft six-power resolution. No voting action was taken.
                    For the record, see U.N. document S/PV.523.</p>
            </div>
